  "code": "// Cycles the RGB LED through a rainbow using PWM.\nconst int R = 9, G = 10, B = 11;\n\nvoid setColor(int r, int g, int b) {\n  analogWrite(R, r);\n  analogWrite(G, g);\n  analogWrite(B, b);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  setColor(255, 0, 0);\n  delay(500);\n  setColor(0, 255, 0);\n  delay(500);\n  setColor(0, 0, 255);\n  delay(500);\n  setColor(255, 255, 0);\n  delay(500);\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(R, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(G, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(B, OUTPUT);\n}\n"
 },
