  "code": "// Press the button to toggle the relay, which switches the motor.\nconst int BUTTON = 2;\nconst int RELAY = 8;\nbool motorOn = false;\nbool lastBtn = false;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(BUTTON, INPUT_PULLUP);\n  pinMode(RELAY, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  bool btn = digitalRead(BUTTON) == LOW;\n  if (btn && !lastBtn) {\n    motorOn = !motorOn;\n    digitalWrite(RELAY, motorOn ? HIGH : LOW);\n    Serial.println(motorOn ? \"Motor ON\" : \"Motor OFF\");\n  }\n  lastBtn = btn;\n  delay(30);\n}\n"
 },
