  "code": "// Reads a knob, a light sensor, and a motion sensor.\nconst int PIR = 2;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(PIR, INPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int knob = analogRead(A0);\n  int light = analogRead(A1);\n  int motion = digitalRead(PIR);\n  Serial.println(\"knob=\" + String(knob) + \" light=\" + String(light) + \" motion=\" + String(motion));\n  delay(300);\n}\n"
